i.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/3bf6ca7ac076bc0330b65d244e3b46f398674de8/comments","author":{"login":"johannes117","id":51395795,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMzk1Nzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51395795?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117","html_url":"https://github.com/johannes117","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"d60560d695e8c436e11dee96965e7a1447409737","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/d60560d695e8c436e11dee96965e7a1447409737","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/d60560d695e8c436e11dee96965e7a1447409737"}]},{"sha":"d60560d695e8c436e11dee96965e7a1447409737","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGQ2MDU2MGQ2OTVlOGM0MzZlMTFkZWU5Njk2NWU3YTE0NDc0MDk3Mzc","commit":{"author":{"name":"Shrikar Seshadri","email":"146694785+davibinboi@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-08-07T19:33:39Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-08-07T19:33:39Z"},"message":"fix(evals): use `gpt-5.6-luna` for research grading (#5337)\n\nA single `judge_models` setting now controls both tau3 and DRBench\ngrading, with `gpt-5.6-luna` as the default for both when the input is\nempty.\n\n---\n\nPinned upstream DRBench hardcodes three model-routing allowlists and\ntherefore rejected the suite default before reaching OpenAI. The\nverifier now registers exactly `gpt-5.6-luna` in those allowlists at\nruntime, allowing it to use the existing `OPENAI_API_KEY` path without\nbroadening support to arbitrary model identifiers.\n\nThe separate `research_judge_models` input is removed. Native DRBench\njudges and suite-wide `openrouter/<vendor>/<model>` judges remain\nsupported; an unsupported bare research judge falls back to\n`gpt-5.6-luna` with a visible workflow warning while other categories\nretain the requested suite-wide judge.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Test plan</summary>\n\n- 75 focused DRBench verifier tests passed, with 1 skipped\n- 43 focused unified-workflow tests passed\n- 471 eval unit tests passed, with 1 skipped\n- 980 GitHub-script tests passed\n- Canonical eval lint, type checking, and catalog validation passed\n- The 226-package eval lock resolved successfully offline\n- `git diff --check` passed\n- [Combined smoke\ndispatch](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/actions/runs/31132860866)\npassed: tau3 earned `1.0` with `JUDGE_MODELS=gpt-5.6-luna`; DR0001\ncompleted with no verifier error and recorded both its requested and\nactual judge as `gpt-5.6-luna`\n\n</details>","tree":{"sha":"b97c3bb5588b364e9867235cfa383dcaf0e4fe0a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/b97c3bb5588b364e9867235cfa383dcaf0e4fe0a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/d60560d695e8c436e11dee96965e7a1447409737","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqdjMTCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAVb4QADE9q/xguyR5HE+BM8ymNxHn\nJpJK+Cuw5fGB/Ni85GyV+Po6+Gr7sTFTrLRksVDsajftY6WchGD2lFEtkvFrQqUH\nyw0jtNHA/6b76OZrM+5ylQMdkEQ7zUWdcpIwNvYc7L1fXKOOuS104JpqI4V7TIMB\n0vQvn5TCXPFHhH8uswol20IavJTetBJaW3psN8cTFUljOa7VRkkwDYoJajTUAemt\n+905yYEEtlUIFsrItbeH7e7JZlfJsQrCyQxFkKKgJUQdGnv+OQSmAsDcL9VXeGHx\n2hSjJPiUScr4gTBs2I/y/Yu/IpHGq00JUoO0yFH3sctny5miN3iS5NfQJVu1xV6/\niBI6tLCv3sn4Gj9fSBaXgMuyj3ux/vN9OuCBVNoDWGhX3kLt3ohhiylctNzEPvju\nXm4FXnX2NShZZ8NTdMnAUEbne9yT7tZ259WdOiQJNnDqeUFMuP1PPqYzBXTLRafk\neOdZGRZiR/o6cYv9TpxNEmZFpKN+8ig1gP1T8BeRMNNDe8WqQXexGGwencSpzlkw\nv9YKtzMqKpEFfFjgm/zfeD9ST321eyAr6+zwq6w2Gn65m0bLrxQDREAHaOGt6Mvr\nsAIrSJ8nXigEJMk4cxetg25FvEykpJ8AnfqTeA8SEi7WnA5aqR2ABvQ4TYoJ+A6E\nAqiEFp0O1dgBSkv9tSL5\n=19DL\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree b97c3bb5588b364e9867235cfa383dcaf0e4fe0a\nparent 81258067f4c74c3ede7d2b2895d9835137ba5977\nauthor Shrikar Seshadri <146694785+davibinboi@users.noreply.github.com> 1786131219 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786131219 -0700\n\nfix(evals): use `gpt-5.6-luna` for research grading (#5337)\n\nA single `judge_models` setting now controls both tau3 and DRBench\ngrading, with `gpt-5.6-luna` as the default for both when the input is\nempty.\n\n---\n\nPinned upstream DRBench hardcodes three model-routing allowlists and\ntherefore rejected the suite default before reaching OpenAI. The\nverifier now registers exactly `gpt-5.6-luna` in those allowlists at\nruntime, allowing it to use the existing `OPENAI_API_KEY` path without\nbroadening support to arbitrary model identifiers.\n\nThe separate `research_judge_models` input is removed. Native DRBench\njudges and suite-wide `openrouter/<vendor>/<model>` judges remain\nsupported; an unsupported bare research judge falls back to\n`gpt-5.6-luna` with a visible workflow warning while other categories\nretain the requested suite-wide judge.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Test plan</summary>\n\n- 75 focused DRBench verifier tests passed, with 1 skipped\n- 43 focused unified-workflow tests passed\n- 471 eval unit tests passed, with 1 skipped\n- 980 GitHub-script tests passed\n- Canonical eval lint, type checking, and catalog validation passed\n- The 226-package eval lock resolved successfully offline\n- `git diff --check` passed\n- [Combined smoke\ndispatch](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/actions/runs/31132860866)\npassed: tau3 earned `1.0` with `JUDGE_MODELS=gpt-5.6-luna`; DR0001\ncompleted with no verifier error and recorded both its requested and\nactual judge as `gpt-5.6-luna`\n\n</details>","verified_at":"2026-08-07T19:33:42Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/d60560d695e8c436e11dee96965e7a1447409737","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/d60560d695e8c436e11dee96965e7a1447409737","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/d60560d695e8c436e11dee96965e7a1447409737/comments","author":{"login":"davibinboi","id":146694785,"node_id":"U_kgDOCL5igQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146694785?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davibinboi","html_url":"https://github.com/davibinboi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davibinboi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davibinboi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davibinboi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davibinboi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davibinboi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davibinboi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davibinboi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davibinboi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davibinboi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"81258067f4c74c3ede7d2b2895d9835137ba5977","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/81258067f4c74c3ede7d2b2895d9835137ba5977","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/81258067f4c74c3ede7d2b2895d9835137ba5977"}]},{"sha":"81258067f4c74c3ede7d2b2895d9835137ba5977","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDgxMjU4MDY3ZjRjNzRjM2VkZTdkMmIyODk1ZDk4MzUxMzdiYTU5Nzc","commit":{"author":{"name":"github-actions[bot]","email":"41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-08-07T15:37:38Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-08-07T15:37:38Z"},"message":"release(deepagents-code): 0.1.54 (#5364)\n\n> [!CAUTION]\n> Merging this PR will automatically publish to **PyPI** and create a\n**GitHub release**.\n\nFor the full release process, see\n[`.github/RELEASING.md`](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/blob/main/.github/RELEASING.md).\n\n---\n\n_Release notes preview: keep this section in sync with the package\n`CHANGELOG.md`. Publish reads the merged CHANGELOG via `release.yml`,\nnot this PR description — keep them aligned anyway so the PR stays an\naccurate historical record for reviewers and anyone returning later._\n\n---\n\n\n##\n[0.1.54](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/compare/deepagents-code==0.1.53...deepagents-code==0.1.54)\n(2026-08-07)\n\n### Features\n\n- Added Meta `muse-spark-1.2` to the model switcher\n([#5389](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/5389)).\n- Improved diff readability with quieter hunks and word-level highlights\n([#5106](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/5106)).\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n- Hid startup tips when resuming threads\n([#5349](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/5349)).\n- Prevented post-tool hook replay\n([#5376](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/5376)).\n- Stored update logs under the OS cache directory\n([#5363](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/5363)).\n\n_End release notes preview._\n\n---\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> A **New Contributors** section is appended to the GitHub release notes\nautomatically at publish time (see [Release\nPipeline](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/blob/main/.github/RELEASING.md#release-pipeline),\nstep 2).\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: langchain-oss-automated-triage[bot] <248757908+langchain-oss-automated-triage[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"0e220cb1e7ec0e813cb16edcae7f2cdf45f6f84f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/0e220cb1e7ec0e813cb16edcae7f2cdf45f6f84f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/81258067f4c74c3ede7d2b2895d9835137ba5977","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqdfvCCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAUiwQAKoe9yyjoycuOMGFh0qjO7Ma\n3o6nThVUF5UB2COyZtrpwd4m5eFq8n+H3ljZL2mUmpYLN/BjxhxV0hrvUCBr7vWH\nmJy2EKv6/uVaqb1tsE5Tcf80hVBYK/EwX5q28gbqjuXL4AN7BDI7WebJhaKPVeXo\n/KGYobVtqlu9UiLibcyYB1DG71mkBYpL2BpgMFtoCogsIU1do4Ri2LZnabuwukvF\nCmCDngb7pxdiY7/niHMoYP46kVgPn//Y6D1ElreNrQ52efU6d1/B2aisH1prvZtn\nkbIgRWp9znBr+ti/yKq4g9ILEyPhYBv1AVE1Kfl7JXUh+gwlhQ8bYhwFfCZPAM5b\nlvvWPL9LgkduXn8haxetOvSQv/+T4IhtbV3yhE5lSyVNebN7DPg8jN5qyaA62Z39\nORiLfx0Ab2foXq9Y+gMRrkV+YO/RDP/rGMulV6BYvPCFhvMT6UhaXREkklbIInCh\n3BYZVX9lVOgHfegptu4oY0AJ1P79UC5rL2rgeLg6Us0IGRRmcRApN8jNSOokHg/L\nw55OJvVqZJnRZlI+7oSR32rJRRL2oxCNczfOx4Yc2JR8oTmfhfBNaEGgVqNz4kp1\nP8T3rvkxC0rxd0L/ruYsk2bhR0qrSbbpYvmf9NHzS8GHW8gGw+/m1Lz3rn4edciK\nRFObOJ7/88vOkydHNLct\n=0NMV\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 0e220cb1e7ec0e813cb16edcae7f2cdf45f6f84f\nparent e668d30ba7b9915348af83dbaf781e89c3b81f16\nauthor github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1786117058 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786117058 -0400\n\nrelease(deepagents-code): 0.1.54 (#5364)\n\n> [!CAUTION]\n> Merging this PR will automatically publish to **PyPI** and create a\n**GitHub release**.\n\nFor the full release process, see\n[`.github/RELEASING.md`](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/blob/main/.github/RELEASING.md).\n\n---\n\n_Release notes preview: keep this section in sync with the package\n`CHANGELOG.md`. Publish reads the merged CHANGELOG via `release.yml`,\nnot this PR description — keep them aligned anyway so the PR stays an\naccurate historical record for reviewers and anyone returning later._\n\n---\n\n\n##\n[0.1.54](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/compare/deepagents-code==0.1.53...deepagents-code==0.1.54)\n(2026-08-07)\n\n### Features\n\n- Added Meta `muse-spark-1.2` to the model switcher\n([#5389](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/5389)).\n- Improved diff readability with quieter hunks and word-level highlights\n([#5106](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/5106)).\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n- Hid startup tips when resuming threads\n([#5349](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/5349)).\n- Prevented post-tool hook replay\n([#5376](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/5376)).\n- Stored update logs under the OS cache directory\n([#5363](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/5363)).\n\n_End release notes preview._\n\n---\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> A **New Contributors** section is appended to the GitHub release notes\nautomatically at publish time (see [Release\nPipeline](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/blob/main/.github/RELEASING.md#release-pipeline),\nstep 2).\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: langchain-oss-automated-triage[bot] <248757908+langchain-oss-automated-triage[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-08-07T15:37:41Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/81258067f4c74c3ede7d2b2895d9835137ba5977","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/81258067f4c74c3ede7d2b2895d9835137ba5977","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/81258067f4c74c3ede7d2b2895d9835137ba5977/comments","author":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.gith