\"Production-ready, extensible agent\nharness with a built-in filesystem and context management, sub-agent\ndelegation, skills, and long-term memory.\"","tree":{"sha":"1ef0bb55da1b5a54324dd4542d643cad034b8793","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/1ef0bb55da1b5a54324dd4542d643cad034b8793"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/889f217dd558254c1d9e77dca307fb326a5b1c21","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqdQ2GCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAPOUQAIYEvDIZWXbh7J9SNY8EA98o\nvhh6ITIHyJyZOHfR6Y/Rr7BkMVCHcyDU10yhfc8OhYanZGHQcnQFe45UsPBVLK6e\npzyF8gMSHanBXiN7xhaxV8h3BB+j839KxAVOTkpUCYHCDxPq8eUOYWEw4bhjHD9h\neou9ht/YNLkni60cvMSunNlmwp1HB1ffXOEQPSiroiCxGzmdaoo59wg2fWJ3Pm1q\n/SLGAMMbiq1yRkp3SEO5+YkAcxz1JUCAddKyalE0bfmt2EzrPRnvfNWbLsBAHVgt\neaG7C3+DcAu0t83OLWDgT3DsZBPnEIRN6TBIc3yTQOZ1P0StteN8VuLvthmWDA4b\nlRkEPHdy8CUk8PrU+GKM8soX2O8/bIE2TCDx8JWb+NyKOz1SBws/KJW1pFlNUEKe\nZ+zd2UOnxE0p24pNdvN1fXSz3/BElxRxW+Uq0RWJoMztda0/iT8zAGD23+l1WfYw\nr0js69bsnTV2O/vqOaH+FcW5g8Gb9X/9ciCk/mqye5ad5zsy7knWLzAt0ad/At+N\npBjN3/Qtrt3hd7gL+S22IfO2DbK0dxxlDv3ojK1HiWqaspz5NezkvNJbixjymOww\n4pEEf2U+r6dD4F2skt2DhLbop1itRneKdYfmX9YAzEyHF5iEf7v7FGXzI9AkgHxy\nhs9rtO3VT/zd6ZmkFR8o\n=AWFG\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 1ef0bb55da1b5a54324dd4542d643cad034b8793\nparent f5fda05892e92e3897324574bb5c36125059778b\nauthor Nishitha M <32355027+imnishitha@users.noreply.github.com> 1786056070 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786056070 -0400\n\ndocs(sdk): update deepagents package description (#5379)\n\nChange description on PyPi page to \"Production-ready, extensible agent\nharness with a built-in filesystem and context management, sub-agent\ndelegation, skills, and long-term memory.\"","verified_at":"2026-08-06T22:41:14Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/889f217dd558254c1d9e77dca307fb326a5b1c21","html_url":"https:/