s by default across interactive and headless sessions.\n\n---\n\nRemoves the runtime, trust, cwd-switch, and main/subagent server\nmiddleware experimental gates while preserving workspace trust and\nconfigured-event runtime gating.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/019fcdad-507a-778b-9ab6-f3741f9cdf80)\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"66c8a15454173856528b6c7e9afc332e433948fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/66c8a15454173856528b6c7e9afc332e433948fb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/4edebdedd61d6793f0f7b666f5ee26b414576805","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqciGdCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAyJQQAEQ4lVVu/dSeCVgJq1nOE6eR\ns7abfGl7XmXxhcE+ohnsu4G59xshSSs9YrHRvwiIpEfdkUAC0w9FLlnk8oI8QWen\nriEUoCEXR3SR+Yyd/vKosQHJ6LoD+EmocK0I80QW2/azc0jFNvwT+U8cRgJXbko0\nqNbgKIx17ry/rfuwWXhNZBoRd964kdrtM3UJ4CaouBgU1IdSBncRTZkZeAiS5Zsi\nnvpX9zxZk8q7a/RQMSBLrypSTbbdlEKvhhyJdX9zS+WXm7rh/NtKaogIYZoXRido\naRPei87qz9yVxsnwzvDEZArMxTsDeiRrThdR6vru/t/z0Mdokjxpwv/oX4ot/frT\nSaQYhhPVPXWFLtVLt+sXY2ulXxaFZEyClNzQaol4UQGbJsB9lRGyAxS/MdvlmkPS\nY6NWokrCgbl+IW325XNIyKRXioduAKinb/TNb1YyXD869D9wK83/UmoxJOEsocsR\nVGVwXqEP5/xltPH12kWFAo5fmqJ759qguE+6aQKaA5V7YJMW9WSUnZhutG/qgkxm\neJxagUYyURaniwScDL5bbupRH/70TCxZ3AmHTvNeF8ymkksr6islx+GnsvLKwR52\nLEYPYhaJu1gwQlqZOduQ/3E4/JKur90Xch1C/XO/69vU5QX7spOQR9sgMeTuEv+i\nt31lymo5uf+DaLHQAxus\n=0ZvK\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 66c8a15454173856528b6c7e9afc332e433948fb\nparent 7bd977bc9d4c11aad90dbef7872d83c2affd584e\nauthor Johannes du Plessis <johannes@langchain.dev> 1785864605 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785864605 -0700\n\nfeat(code): make Hooks v2 generally available (#5307)\n\nHooks v2 now loads by default across interactive and headless sessions.\n\n---\n\nRemoves the runtime, trust, cwd-switch, and main/subagent server\nmiddleware experimental gates while preserving workspace trust and\nconfigured-event runtime gating.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/019fcdad-507a-778b-9ab6-f3741f9cdf80)\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-08-04T17:30:09Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/4edebdedd61d6793f0f7b666f5ee26b414576805","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/4edebdedd61d6793f0f7b666f5ee26b414576805","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/4edebdedd61d6793f0f7b666f5ee26b414576805/comments","author":{"login":"johannes117","id":51395795,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMzk1Nzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51395795?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117","html_url":"https://github.com/johannes117","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"7bd977bc9d4c11aad90dbef7872d83c2affd584e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/7bd977bc9d4c11aad90dbef7872d83c2affd584e","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/7bd977bc9d4c11aad90dbef7872d83c2affd584e"}]},{"sha":"7bd977bc9d4c11aad90dbef7872d83c2affd584e","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDdiZDk3N2JjOWQ0YzExYWFkOTBkYmVmNzg3MmQ4M2MyYWZmZDU4NGU","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-08-04T17:29:00Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-08-04T17:29:00Z"},"message":"feat(code): configurable Auto classifier review timeout (#5302)\n\nThe deadline the Auto approval classifier gets to review one batch of\ngated actions is now configurable via\n`DEEPAGENTS_CODE_AUTO_CLASSIFIER_TIMEOUT` or\n`[models].auto_classifier_timeout`, instead of being fixed at 20\nseconds.\n\n---\n\nAuto mode reviews gated tool calls with an LLM authorization classifier.\nThat review had a hardcoded 20-second budget: a batch that missed it was\ndenied as `classifier_unavailable`, the tool call never ran, and\nrepeated misses escalated to manual approval. Users on a slow or heavily\nloaded classifier model hit this regularly and had no way to raise it —\n`AutoModeHITLMiddleware` already accepted a `classifier_timeout_seconds`\nkeyword, but nothing in the app ever passed one, so only tests could\nchange it.\n\nThe option follows the same shape as the existing\n`runtime.recursion_limit` knob rather than inventing a new pattern: a\ntyped default and explicit floor/ceiling constants in the config\nmanifest, and a `resolve_auto_classifier_timeout` resolver with env →\n`config.toml` → default precedence.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/c4f6be86-91f4-276e-1a34-7e4c1eb3c95f)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"d01b7f0cc7bcfa85f911b02208eaf11f3f1d8575","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/d01b7f0cc7bcfa85f911b02208eaf11f3f1d8575"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/7bd977bc9d4c11aad90dbef7872d83c2affd584e","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqciFcCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAHU0QAA7he471rdUVKc0SIdirI5Dv\n/PYPzfTTP9fDRIf9pWdZKhgGsJ/0xBFyqWcE0F4EKK4WOUnzANvY+DTnBj0GKazN\nC71rjlQxjLmMxT4plaXdabcAwE4niiJTmkboWtKRtqr5smpJxqS1cfGd+Bn1l4Dc\nnM4GVyuaz/i/TIBUuS/WeFSlpo9VUUBjPgTzV8weGhnt++UrrsWye+saF8KKPcy8\njyhF2OHQVV0tyo5RPg1KPAC7P52erf9jUpq8IJdXAkk4I8LXBXz3pTR66dgRAFc3\nLDXh1bTD9SCU+LINRjsnnkP0xIWxFKnx9OnRbvqSiT9+BWZpGyROKVvf232+NiwX\nV5uNtNrKZ/XixB4FLjuat2Cetwu6t4xKkRkws3lQrXvEYSuRRuZR4XvN561I2yjz\nIAmlKDM3/BMYtCnBTllhS5kIxDu+rYyP8EKBNAx6A7G6q2O6YlfEGYgYf0t/Vf41\nBpHlb+eVjQ9v6eOwXlFVYgUOnHqtAwuj4zNst5mqMsxNKFiWxsQdgzwjOV273Cll\nUtU/+VblQ8rNOyR0E/smW68Lha5IOoq5kppDpsdriaSBMCuuJ/d9/oMMW/7m49Xn\n5bX6H641aOqE+22r8ZkM40dhkvJilv3MNyRxhGE1bt2RCEmwT6thLJCeAw0d/qDg\nOYMTjlv/vr8XLv5TmpWf\n=g44h\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree d01b7f0cc7bcfa85f911b02208eaf11f3f1d8575\nparent 6f48dd59efd27c3476cf32cb8c965155c59993a5\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1785864540 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785864540 -0400\n\nfeat(code): configurable Auto classifier review timeout (#5302)\n\nThe deadline the Auto approval classifier gets to review one batch of\ngated actions is now configurable via\n`DEEPAGENTS_CODE_AUTO_CLASSIFIER_TIMEOUT` or\n`[models].auto_classifier_timeout`, instead of being fixed at 20\nseconds.\n\n---\n\nAuto mode reviews gated tool calls with an LLM authorization classifier.\nThat review had a hardcoded 20-second budget: a batch that missed it was\ndenied as `classifier_unavailable`, the tool call never ran, and\nrepeated misses escalated to manual approval. Users on a slow or heavily\nloaded classifier model hit this regularly and had no way to raise it —\n`AutoModeHITLMiddleware` already accepted a `classifier_timeout_seconds`\nkeyword, but nothing in the app ever passed one, so only tests could\nchange it.\n\nThe option follows the same shape as the existing\n`runtime.recursion_limit` knob rather than inventing a new pattern: a\ntyped default and explicit floor/ceiling constants in the config\nmanifest, and a `resolve_auto_classifier_timeout` resolver with env →\n`config.toml` → default precedence.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/c4f6be86-91f4-276e-1a34-7e4c1eb3c95f)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-08-04T17:29:04Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/7bd977bc9d4c11aad90dbef7872d83c2affd584e","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/7bd977bc9d4c11aad90dbef7872d83c2affd584e","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/7bd977bc9d4c11aad90dbef7872d83c2affd584e/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"6f48dd59efd27c3476cf32cb8c965155c59993a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/6f48dd59efd27c3476cf32cb8c965155c59993a5","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/6f48dd59efd27c3476cf32cb8c965155c59993a5"}]},{"sha":"6f48dd59efd27c3476cf32cb8c965155c59993a5","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDZmNDhkZDU5ZWZkMjdjMzQ3NmNmMzJjYjhjOTY1MTU1YzU5OTkzYTU","commit":{"author":{"name":"Alexander Olsen","email":"aolsenjazz@gmail.com","date":"2026-08-04T16:18:58Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-08-04T16:18:58Z"},"message":"fix(code): refresh hooks after cwd switches (#5249)\n\nProject hooks now reload and request trust when a resumed thread\nswitches dcode into another workspace.\n\n---\n\nCwd switches previously reused the launch workspace's hook runtime and\ntrust decision. The new TUI gate fails closed, keeps explicit-only\npolicies non-interactive, binds allow-once grants to the approved file\ncontents, and restores the prior runtime on rollback.\n\n<details><summary>Test plan</summary>\n\n- `uv run --group test pytest -q tests/unit_tests/hooks/`\n- Focused hook-trust modal and cwd-switch app tests\n- `make lint`\n\n</details>\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/b3525439-d3ec-e34a-cfa0-e9095c516761)\n\n## References\n- Plan:\nhttps://openswe.vercel.app/agents/b3525439-d3ec-e34a-cfa0-e9095c516761/plan\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Alexander Olsen <13665641+aolsenjazz@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Johannes du Plessis <johannes@langchain.dev>","tree":{"sha":"950d93ed21de8ef91d6e1718279f27c1bcc36291","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/950d93ed21de8ef91d6e1718279f27c1bcc36291"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/6f48dd59efd27c3476cf32cb8c965155c59993a5","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqchDyCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAFxUQAEmRQB8xDsu6DlBBkmzMPX/c\nhy97gb8T+KGPxp74xg8p3kJvS3E+YMJtGsBKmgFqG9WcmqyVWxpjdLeiEgInMHwm\n3cOSGhORwg5fDesYIfXwtSC9Evve/3ISEY3FIc3wkPlVwf59ubkwSTOQC1W9UlFB\niZbLQVPki3obd042kR/Gi0SWtLaiL2eaAHo88uksirtq37RZIg8XDA2z4u/x5U+k\nLQtjhqDpyzs5j+K4u70X/OA0TMVZfgKYlIOLw+hM/uv+9QUSVqPZy5wIPhDf7COU\np5WKjQduqenliFX1qKtuJ2w5x7YT75dN/eqgzwEGydrhMMXqGK3pm/+YTEtfDQ5J\nKt+z2EbSp8riBQm7BmVoPqXxiN7RA9n1FBFGBiSMsiXT+MpxGbiuHdHdtE0M3jan\nAW8PwiFrM9Dbv9TILUQNaRODAfqz2dA+yn6Kk3ofIK6qQxNutkHcPaisYfNF5lCg\nGq87yD4QrHHSSJ2sAuLMtdevyJ2sg99BHM/qjEShkPEq77vA5LA46ZBncfb64faa\nSoAL2OxJFoH/+pebWpuUD4iYdrhPB4J3NQUR4aVRd7BtzNvrB9ZvHhtphwp2v4ja\nCRc4jE2Y4F3ruy20KbdJ4HDR993qpN24o2Icld3ikxMfjnmuxU3gs857NieDMueK\nPJp7wGc0UbrvvWijueJJ\n=SvK7\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 950d93ed21de8ef91d6e1718279f27c1bcc36291\nparent 553a030a5b959ac8bb17d52447f915397f910f03\nauthor Alexander Olsen <aolsenjazz@gmail.com> 1785860338 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785860338 +0000\n\nfix(code): refresh hooks after cwd switches (#5249)\n\nProject hooks now reload and request trust when a resumed thread\nswitches dcode into another workspace.\n\n---\n\nCwd switches previously reused the launch workspace's hook runtime and\ntrust decision. The new TUI gate fails closed, keeps explicit-only\npolicies non-interactive, binds allow-once grants to the approved file\ncontents, and restores the prior runtime on rollback.\n\n<details><summary>Test plan</summary>\n\n- `uv run --group test pytest -q tests/unit_tests/hooks/`\n- Focused hook-trust modal and cwd-switch app tests\n- `make lint`\n\n</details>\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/b3525439-d3ec-e34a-cfa0-e9095c516761)\n\n## References\n- Plan:\nhttps://openswe.vercel.app/agents/b3525439-d3ec-e34a-cfa0-e9095c516761/plan\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Alexander Olsen <13665641+aolsenjazz@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Johannes du Plessis <johannes@langchain.dev>","verified_at":"2026-08-04T16:19:01Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/6f48dd59efd27c3476cf32cb8c965155c59993a5","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/6f48dd59efd27c3476cf32cb8c965155c59993a5","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/6f48dd59efd27c3476cf32cb8c965155c59993a5/comments","author":{"login":"aolsenjazz","id":13665641,"node_