IiiQG9xJ4RgTXsxqS9DW28+c4ZfFiI\nADlgo9OMKGW4F6xuyKXLgIK1Cs1f4pGNLSwOx/Vm6R0+0A/LU0aaDkmJQUBgfFiG\nncejH9V3o5h9OJaP77rExNZ4owLHqbl6O/lCd4KjspmvCgGsHKLXcB4Y0LjfecxT\ni4BgF5q+xj83D9i8obBL\n=ojHW\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree f839f0a97833d2b96d87e7fa6fe39e0af30c5fc4\nparent ed0e3e236eea691d7c8c586ac1f9c82eba352b1a\nauthor Johannes du Plessis <johannes@langchain.dev> 1785809096 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785809096 -0700\n\nfix(code): fire `PreCompact` before auto-compaction (#5277)\n\nAutomatic threshold compaction now runs `PreCompact` with\n`trigger=\"auto\"` before summarizing context.\n\n---\n\nThe dcode compaction middleware mirrors the SDK eligibility check and\ninvokes the existing server hook gate before the inner summarizer runs.\nBlocking the hook skips that compaction attempt without dropping\nargument truncation.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/019fc9ab-d293-72b0-9272-72dd41023214)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-08-04T02:04:59Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/f4cc5160c75eb44e8ddee8b049048690ea0f8616","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/f4cc5160c75eb44e8ddee8b049048690ea0f8616","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/f4cc5160c75eb44e8ddee8b049048690ea0f8616/comments","author":{"login":"johannes117","id":51395795,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMzk1Nzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51395795?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117","html_url":"https://github.com/johannes117","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscription