1a4b6fdc2da\"><code>2781b95</code></a>\n[PR <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/aio-libs/aiohttp/issues/13042\">#13042</a>/b48737e7\nbackport][3.14] catch unknown charset when decoding conte...</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/aio-libs/aiohttp/commit/73c834796a57d71513701255ee7e70164bef3715\"><code>73c8347</code></a>\n[PR <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/aio-libs/aiohttp/issues/13128\">#13128</a>/bb3cb60f\nbackport][3.14] Dependabot cooldown and versioning-strate...</li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/aio-libs/aiohttp/compare/v3.14.1...v3.14.2\">compare\nview</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\n\n[![Dependabot compatibility\nscore](https://dependabot-badges.githubapp.com/badges/compatibility_score?dependency-name=aiohttp&package-manager=uv&previous-version=3.14.1&new-version=3.14.2)](https://docs.github.com/en/github/managing-security-vulnerabilities/about-dependabot-security-updates#about-compatibility-scores)\n\nDependabot will resolve any conflicts with this PR as long as you don't\nalter it yourself. You can also trigger a rebase manually by commenting\n`@dependabot rebase`.\n\n[//]: # (dependabot-automerge-start)\n[//]: # (dependabot-automerge-end)\n\n---\n\n<details>\n<summary>Dependabot commands and options</summary>\n<br />\n\nYou can trigger Dependabot actions by commenting on this PR:\n- `@dependabot rebase` will rebase this PR\n- `@dependabot recreate` will recreate this PR, overwriting any edits\nthat have been made to it\n- `@dependabot show <dependency name> ignore conditions` will show all\nof the ignore conditions of the specified dependency\n- `@dependabot ignore this major version` will close this PR and stop\nDependabot creating any more for this major version (unless you reopen\nthe PR or upgrade to it yourself)\n- `@dependabot ignore this minor version` will close this PR and stop\nDependabot creating any more for this minor version (unless you reopen\nthe PR or upgrade to it yourself)\n- `@dependabot ignore this dependency` will close this PR and stop\nDependabot creating any more for this dependency (unless you reopen the\nPR or upgrade to it yourself)\nYou can disable automated security fix PRs for this repo from the\n[Security Alerts\npage](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/network/alerts).\n\n</details>\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\nCo-authored-by: dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-08-03T21:00:43Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/3d8c269244bbb4dd5c7eedd6643d0dddd11403d6","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/3d8c269244bbb4dd5c7eedd6643d0dddd11403d6","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/3d8c269244bbb4dd5c7eedd6643d0dddd11403d6/comments","author":{"login":"dependabot[bot]","id":49699333,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDk2OTkzMzM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/29110?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/dependabot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"2454afa58521f9dddb64bbde364a475694f45f4d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/2454afa58521f9dddb64bbde364a475694f45f4d","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/2454afa58521f9dddb64bbde364a475694f45f4d"}]},{"sha":"2454afa58521f9dddb64bbde364a475694f45f4d","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDI0NTRhZmE1ODUyMWY5ZGRkYjY0YmJkZTM2NGE0NzU2OTRmNDVmNGQ","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-08-03T20:53:08Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-08-03T20:53:08Z"},"message":"feat(code): refresh price catalog hourly in the background (#5264)\n\nCost estimates can now pick up new model prices without waiting for a\ndcode release. Once cost estimates are first used, dcode checks for\nupdated pricing data in the background every hour.\n\nTo use only the pricing data bundled with dcode, set\n`DEEPAGENTS_CODE_PRICES_AUTO_UPDATE=0` or `[update].prices_auto_update =\nfalse` in `config.toml`. Offline mode also disables these downloads.\n\n---\n\nNew model prices can be unavailable until a dcode release updates its\nbundled pricing data. This change refreshes that data in the background\nafter pricing is first needed, so it does not add work at startup.\n\nIf an update fails or appears incomplete, dcode keeps using the pricing\ndata it already has.\n\nSupersedes #5262 (same commits; branch renamed to match repo naming\nconvention).","tree":{"sha":"8716223689b6716be6e9597cdacaa0327a6f4cc2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/8716223689b6716be6e9597cdacaa0327a6f4cc2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/2454afa58521f9dddb64bbde364a475694f45f4d","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqcP+0CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA0R8QAH/mGDMIPhmPRt2dKbqdX37x\ncvOtYV3UCAHcOYMLqAwqNxIXqpJyLmxybprnLh4IbE/GrWwGaZKrK+kBahdfxTV7\n2xjY13GcaVH1B8o9EJemxiitIrnZw359UUG2vVVvtaEjbkFgToUDQtRh0A5XNGWj\nJzv5yVy/Rks2Z3XC5yj2klIbjETPSuWDQFn8LaDjLql51VB/N2Oo5kI9x29eFcvW\nfTiViEAUH3F0K4Nn8a33enuj55ntCeaaJ3O1kBpbdl5XorQgl9xiVm/wauqT+EaA\nSxz45xvq087YMZwrxqXjNuqcyu3ber3SbC2PdwWPRe5bjbtelnUwsmP/YFxCWQb0\nuFENmBERTjtHD0E9cWGSul3Ftut955Ni+9lQdfbc19u77XvRp3Q/phSRkKvJM+BQ\n5MtVM8wv4zwh7sJX5oVieQZufoxXX0HOhBywzMOQJmEkoKxc+pkzEA2hyzwgkIED\nkWNiQRknciGdoeovGZzVLv/XtpE4EwPFKQkryBi6NFTpMudB+qUJpCCH9MehJRsi\nqiHuPPreFNVezVfAYfMWxIzH1OLK9vDcF19PqW4wR0QiDfK0oIujJPmDcMqEVhSn\nT0XsYnm2qHiMlJE9dinoVcCmq5spD+ELiT6DciF9X6jO4tS9BPfqR4Ek42K6XOo2\ngNHPVD7sbBC668Skd7Mn\n=XR1U\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 8716223689b6716be6e9597cdacaa0327a6f4cc2\nparent c258153ab8a0120f352eed69a02fb0c27267bf54\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1785790388 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785790388 -0400\n\nfeat(code): refresh price catalog hourly in the background (#5264)\n\nCost estimates can now pick up new model prices without waiting for a\ndcode release. Once cost estimates are first used, dcode checks for\nupdated pricing data in the background every hour.\n\nTo use only the pricing data bundled with dcode, set\n`DEEPAGENTS_CODE_PRICES_AUTO_UPDATE=0` or `[update].prices_auto_update =\nfalse` in `config.toml`. Offline mode also disables these downloads.\n\n---\n\nNew model prices can be unavailable until a dcode release updates its\nbundled pricing data. This change refreshes that data in the background\nafter pricing is first needed, so it does not add work at startup.\n\nIf an update fails or appears incomplete, dcode keeps using the pricing\ndata it already has.\n\nSupersedes #5262 (same commits; branch renamed to match repo naming\nconvention).","verified_at":"2026-08-03T20:53:11Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/2454afa58521f9dddb64bbde364a475694f45f4d","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/2454afa58521f9dddb64bbde364a475694f45f4d","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/2454afa58521f9dddb64bbde364a475694f45f4d/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url"